## Context

Commit c4064de on main introduced a `gh pr diff` reference in
`skills/raid/SKILL.md:117` without a `<!-- harness-extension-point -->`
escape hatch. The leak-guard CI check greps the full tree (not just the
diff), so this blocks ALL PRs from passing CI.

Discovered while attempting to merge PR #141 (ticket 0117).

## Actions

1. Add `<!-- harness-extension-point -->` on the line preceding the `gh`
   reference in `skills/raid/SKILL.md`, OR reword to remove the `gh`
   reference entirely.
2. Push fix to main and verify leak-guard CI passes.

## Test

```bash
bash scripts/check-project-leak.sh skills
# Expected: exit 0 (no leaks)
```

## Exit criteria

- leak-guard CI passes on main.
- No `\bgh ` matches in `skills/` without escape hatch.
- PR #141 (ticket 0117) unblocked.
